# Generated mirror of .claude/skills/, written by the multi-CLI skill sync.
# NOT tracked, deliberately. It is a transformed copy: the sync rewrites
# `.claude/` to `.Codex/` in the prose, and no `.Codex/` directory exists here,
# so every command in the mirrored SKILL.md is a dead path while the original
# works. Tracking it would publish broken instructions on a public repo and
# create a second copy that drifts from the one under .claude/. Sibling projects
# abbey and wdbx track zero .agents files; abi tracks them because it OWNS the
# sync mechanism, which is a different situation.
.agents/
